\">分隔；划分；隔开；划定（范围）；指挥；管理；运营；组织；负责；结算账目；清账；（相扑）交锋前俯身作势；摆好初次冲撞的预备姿势</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"125488\"><ruby>庭<rp>(</rp><rt>にわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>柵<rp>(</rp><rt>さく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>小道<rp>(</rp><rt>こみち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>仕切<rp>(</rp><rt>しき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>られている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The garden is railed off from the path.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">資金</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しきん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">资金；资本</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211286\">その<ruby>計画<rp>(</rp><rt>けいかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>資金<rp>(</rp><rt>しきん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>不足<rp>(</rp><rt>ふそく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>していた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Money for the plan was lacking.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">敷く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">铺开；展开（如铺被子）；铺下；垫上（如铺垫子）；广泛实施；颁布（如实施戒严令）；按住；压住；铺设（如铁轨）；部署；配置（如军队）；蔓延；传播（如雪覆盖）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"183468\"><ruby>机<rp>(</rp><rt>つくえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のしたにカーペットを<ruby>敷<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I put down a rug under my desk.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">しくじる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span 